From: Waltteri Hooli <1420194+wahooli@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 17:41:08 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 2/5] freedreno: Disable early preamble and scalar predicates
 on a7xx gen1

Adreno 730/725 class GPUs misrender and hang with them.

Origin: https://github.com/Weab-chan/freedreno_turnip-CI patches/a7xx_gen1_random_stuff.patch
Also carried as: https://github.com/WinNative-Emu/Drivers patches/apply_a7xx_gen1_quirks.py
---
 src/freedreno/common/freedreno_devices.py | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/freedreno/common/freedreno_devices.py b/src/freedreno/common/freedreno_devices.py
index 396918c..a3c9429 100644
--- a/src/freedreno/common/freedreno_devices.py
+++ b/src/freedreno/common/freedreno_devices.py
@@ -823,6 +823,8 @@ a7xx_gen1 = GPUProps(
         reading_shading_rate_requires_smask_quirk = True,
         QCTDD08407086 = True,
         QCTDD08517960 = True,
+        has_early_preamble = False,
+        has_scalar_predicates = False,
     )
 
 a7xx_gen2 = GPUProps(
